## 2. Camera Synchronization Model

### User requirement
> "Chcę aby w każdym oknie obrót był synchronizowany. W jednym oknie wektory, w drugim airbox, w trzecim wireframe — ale mogę obrócić kamerę w każdym jednocześnie."

### Design: Shared Camera Store

All panes share **one camera state**. Interacting with any pane updates the shared state → all panes re-render.

```typescript
// viewport-3d/store.ts
interface CameraState {
  position: [number, number, number];
  target: [number, number, number];
  up: [number, number, number];
  fov: number;
  near: number;
  far: number;
}

interface Viewport3DStore {
  camera: CameraState;
  setCamera: (patch: Partial<CameraState>) => void;

  gridLayout: ViewportGridLayout;
  panes: ViewportPaneConfig[];
  activePaneId: string;
  // ...
}
```

### Per-Pane Config (layers only)

Each pane controls **which layers are visible** and **display mode**, but NOT the camera:

```typescript
interface ViewportPaneConfig {
  id: string;
  label: string;
  displayMode: DisplayMode;              // shaded, wireframe, etc.
  layers: {
    meshSurface: boolean;
    vectorGlyphs: boolean;
    scalarField: boolean;
    wireframe: boolean;
    airbox: boolean;
    axesGrid: boolean;
    selection: boolean;
    clipPlane: boolean;
  };
}
```

### Example: 3-pane setup

| Pane | layers.vectorGlyphs | layers.airbox | layers.wireframe | displayMode |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Left (main) | ✓ | ✗ | ✗ | shaded |
| Top-right | ✗ | ✓ | ✗ | shaded |
| Bottom-right | ✗ | ✗ | ✓ | wireframe |

Camera rotation in *any* pane → all three panes rotate together.

### R3F Implementation

```tsx
function ViewportPane({ config, renderModel }: PanePropss) {
  const camera = useViewport3DStore((s) => s.camera);
  const setCamera = useViewport3DStore((s) => s.setCamera);

  return (
    <Canvas frameloop="demand" camera={camera}>
      <SyncedOrbitControls camera={camera} onChange={setCamera} />

      {config.layers.meshSurface && <MeshSurfaceLayer topology={renderModel.topology} />}
      {config.layers.scalarField && <ScalarFieldLayer field={renderModel.scalarField} />}
      {config.layers.vectorGlyphs && <VectorGlyphLayer vectors={renderModel.vectorField} />}
      {config.layers.wireframe && <WireframeLayer topology={renderModel.topology} />}
      {config.layers.airbox && <AirboxLayer bounds={renderModel.domain?.bounds} />}
      {config.layers.axesGrid && <AxesGridLayer bounds={renderModel.domain?.bounds} />}
      {config.layers.selection && <SelectionLayer selection={renderModel.selection} />}
      {config.layers.clipPlane && <ClipPlaneLayer clip={renderModel.clip} />}
    </Canvas>
  );
}
```

`SyncedOrbitControls` reads from the shared store and writes back on change. Each `<Canvas>` calls `invalidate()` when the camera store updates → dirty render.

