### Gaps identified

| # | Gap | Status | Fix |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `ControlRoomApi` has no method for `GET /data/domain/meta` | Missing | Add `api.data.domain.meta()` to facade |
| 2 | `ControlRoomApi` has no method for `GET /data/domain/topology` (binary) | Missing | Add `api.data.domain.topology()` → binary → `topologyCodec.decode()` |
| 3 | `ControlRoomApi` has no method for `GET /data/fields/{id}/samples/vector` (binary) | Missing | Add `api.data.fields.vector(quantityId)` → binary → `fieldVectorCodec.decode()` |
| 4 | `ControlRoomApi` has no method for `GET /visualization/state` | Missing | Add `api.visualization.state()` |
| 5 | `ControlRoomApi` has no method for `PATCH /visualization/state` | Missing | Add `api.visualization.patch(body)` |
| 6 | No `useMeshTopology()` hook | Missing | Build on `useResource` pattern |
| 7 | No `useFieldData()` hook | Missing | Build on `useResource` pattern |
| 8 | No `useVisualizationState()` hook | Missing | Build on `useResource` pattern |
| 9 | `three`, `@react-three/fiber`, `@react-three/drei` not in dependencies | Missing | `pnpm add` |

Gaps 1–5 are API facade methods — straightforward additions following the existing `ControlRoomApi` pattern. Gaps 6–8 are resource hooks following the `useSessionStatus` pattern. Gap 9 is a package install.

**Everything else is already wired:** the generated OpenAPI types have `DomainMeta`, `DecodedTopology` codec, `DecodedFieldVector` codec, `VisualizationStateResource`, `ResourceRevisionMap` with independent `topology_revision` and `field_revision`, and the realtime WS invalidation bridge.

