## 5. Delivery Phases (revised)

### Phase 5a — Dependencies + API Facade Extensions
- Add `three`, `@react-three/fiber`, `@react-three/drei` to package.json
- Add API facade methods: `domain.meta()`, `domain.topology()`, `fields.vector()`, `visualization.state()`, `visualization.patch()`
- Add resource hooks: `useDomainMeta`, `useMeshTopology`, `useFieldData`, `useVisualizationState`
- Tests for all new hooks and facade methods

### Phase 5b — Domain Adapters
- Port `SpatialDomainAdapter`, `FdmDomainAdapter`, `FemDomainAdapter` to `src/domain/`
- `buildViewport3DRenderModel()` pure function
- Unit tests for adapters and render model builder

### Phase 5c — Single-Pane Viewport
- Module manifest + module root
- Single `<Canvas>` with `<MeshSurfaceLayer>`
- `SyncedOrbitControls` with camera store
- Basic shaded rendering of topology
- `frameloop="demand"` — verify zero idle frames

### Phase 5d — Field Visualization Layers
- `<ScalarFieldLayer>` — vertex color mapping
- `<VectorGlyphLayer>` — instanced arrows
- `<WireframeLayer>` — edge overlay
- `<AirboxLayer>`, `<AxesGridLayer>`
- Quantity switching without topology rebuild

### Phase 5e — Multi-Viewport Grid
- `<ViewportGrid>` with CSS grid
- `<ViewportPane>` per-pane layer configuration
- Shared camera sync across all panes
- Layout presets (single, split-h, split-v, quad, one-plus-two)
- Toolbar per pane for layer toggles and display mode

### Phase 5f — Selection, Picking, Polish
- `<SelectionLayer>` outline/highlight
- Raycasting pick → `viewport:object-picked` event
- `<ClipPlaneLayer>`
- Context loss recovery
- Memory stress test, idle audit
- Diagnostics surface

