## 6. Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Camera interaction library:**
> drei's `<OrbitControls>` gives orbit/pan/zoom for free. But it might conflict with the camera sync model (it owns its own camera internally). Alternative: build `SyncedOrbitControls` from scratch using drei's `useGesture` or raw pointer events. I lean toward wrapping `OrbitControls` with a sync adapter — less code, proven interaction. Thoughts?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Per-pane quantity override:**
> Currently the plan has all panes showing the same quantity (from `VisualizationStateResource`). Do you want per-pane quantity selection too? E.g., pane 1 shows `m` (magnetization), pane 2 shows `h_eff` (effective field), pane 3 shows airbox only. This would mean per-pane field resource hooks — more memory but very useful for comparison.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Gizmo / transform tool timing:**
> ADR-0007 defines camera vs manipulate modes. Should transform gizmos (move/rotate/scale geometry) be part of Phase 5 or deferred to Phase 4 (geometry-authoring module)?
